# SPOKEDU MASTER governance

For SPOKEDU MASTER work:

1. Read `/AGENTS.md`.
2. Follow `docs/SPOKEDU_MASTER_PRODUCT_CONTRACT.md`.
3. For UI work, follow `app/spokedu-master/MASTER_VISUAL_SYSTEM.md`.
4. Check `app/spokedu-master/MASTER_SURFACE_MATRIX.md` for surface role and rendered-QA status.
5. For SPOMOVE work, follow `app/spokedu-master/spomove/SPOMOVE_PRODUCT_CONTRACT.md`.
6. Implement only the approved user request or completed Sprint Brief scope.
7. Preserve existing product semantics unless an approved Product Decision says otherwise.
8. Do not use archived or superseded contracts as authority.

Do not infer runtime behavior from a pathname or component name alone. Global analysis does not authorize global refactoring.

> Think globally. Decide explicitly. Implement only approved scope.
